  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is between 3 civil society organizations in Bangladesh, Nepal and India, which works on issues of sexual and reproductive health and rights. The project will strengthen the organizations&apos; knowledge and ability to raise awareness on specific SRHR-issues in their respective communities. Specifically, the exchange foucses on include mentrual hygiene management, prevention of sexual transmitted diseases, and puberty changes. Bangladesh, Nepal and India.</narrative>
  </description>
